      {
        "id": 132858,
        "name": "bluedarky",
        "username": "bluedarky",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-21T07:05:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"BenjaminTodd\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ecc23a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BenjaminTodd:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hi all,Does Fanatic's End of Days play trigger before the the environment's start of turn cards? &nbsp;Specifically would Insula Primalas' Pterodactyl Thief already in play trigger before the End of Days?Thanks,Ben</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It depends on the order they entered play.</p>\n<p>If Pterodactyl thief entered play on the environment turn then Fanatic played EoD, Pterodactyl thief would steal all your equipment and hit you.</p>\n<p>If Fanatic played EoD then something caused the top card of the environment to be played before the environment turn and it was Pterodactyl Thief then EoD would destroy it before it could act.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:08:25.014Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 12365,
        "topic_slug": "fanatics-end-of-days",
        "display_username": "bluedarky",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"BenjaminTodd\"]\n\nHi all,Does Fanatic&#39;s End of Days play trigger before the the environment&#39;s start of turn cards? &nbsp;Specifically would Insula Primalas&#39; Pterodactyl Thief already in play trigger before the End of Days?Thanks,Ben\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt depends on the order they entered play.\n\nIf Pterodactyl thief entered play on the environment turn then Fanatic played EoD, Pterodactyl thief would steal all your equipment and hit you.\n\n If Fanatic played EoD then something caused the top card of the environment to be played before the environment turn and it was Pterodactyl Thief then EoD would destroy it before it could act. \n",
